{"product_id":"iqos-iluma-oasis-limited-edition","title":"IQOS Iluma - Oasis Limited Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing the exclusive IQOS LUMA OASIS, a stylish and unique addition to the IQOS family. This sleek gadget will be the perfect choice for those who want to quit conventional cigarettes and switch to a healthier alternative. Thanks to the advanced SMARTCORE INDUCTION SYSTEM tobacco heating technology, you will get the most comfortable and clean use without ash and odor. The amount of contamination is minimized, so you no longer have to spend time cleaning the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe design of OASIS is simply stunning. It is made in bright and saturated colors that will take you to a world of amazing landscapes and adventures. This limited edition will be a great addition to your look and will make you stand out from the crowd.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the millions of IQOS users around the world and start enjoying all the benefits of heated tobacco. Despite the limited edition, you still have the opportunity to own this stylish and functional device. Don't miss your chance!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDevice Colour: OASIS\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNumber of sessions with one full charge: 20 sessions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: 135 min\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHolder dimension \u0026amp; weight:\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight - 101.mm, Diameter - 14.5 mm, Weight - 30.5grm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePocket charger dimension and weight:\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight - 117.2mm, Width — 44.7mm, Weight - 141grm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging port: USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery capacity: 2380mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperating temperature: 0°C ~ 40°C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Connectivity: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDevice Compatible with: TEREA sticks\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging time: 2h 15m\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating temperature: 350 °C (660 °F)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating method: Smartcore induction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating time: 15 sec\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSession length: up to 6 minutes \/ 14 puffs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41710201897015,"sku":"Iluma - Oasis Ltd Edition","price":19990.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-iluma-oasis-limited-edition.jpg?v=1750038453","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-iluma-oasis-limited-edition","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




